{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：00:06 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：00:06 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：00:06 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"跨部門深水埗掃黃拘14內地女 年紀最大61歲。警方提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60510a17c3e37504a1cee1f177459337/2026-11/SSPO.jpg\"/><p>深水埗警區特別職務隊第三隊人員聯同相關部門今日（22日）在區內展開代號「闖岸」（DISTANTSHORE）的掃黃行動，突擊搜查區內多個地點，共拘捕14名女子。</p><p>行動中，人員共拘捕14名內地女子，年齡介乎28至61歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:26:34.600278+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:06:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:46.286291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:03.962821+00:00","content_hash":"a5edab52e005292e9405eb5ecf9f1351af0827b7be27b5756b715d91fcfec11f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}